EKS identity of ServiceAccount shop/api: 6 checks, 1 failed; cloud checks done. Top finding: The trust policy of arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/shop-api does not allow ServiceAccount shop/api.

FINDINGS
1. [critical/high] eks.irsa.trust_mismatch: The trust policy of arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/shop-api does not allow ServiceAccount shop/api
   why: STS refuses AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity unless the role trusts this cluster's OIDC provider and its sub condition matches the ServiceAccount, so the pods get AccessDenied.
   evidence (related): the trust policy's oidc.eks.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/id/ABCDEF:sub condition allows system:serviceaccount:shop:worker but not system:serviceaccount:shop:api (or its :aud does not allow sts.amazonaws.com)
   fix: Add (or correct) a statement allowing sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity for Federated arn:aws:iam::<account>:oidc-provider/oidc.eks.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/id/ABCDEF, with Condition StringEquals oidc.eks.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/id/ABCDEF:sub = system:serviceaccount:shop:api and oidc.eks.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/id/ABCDEF:aud = sts.amazonaws.com.
   docs: https://docs.aws.amazon.com/eks/latest/userguide/iam-roles-for-service-accounts.html

ITEMS (6)
SIDE        CHECK                                        RESULT  DETAIL
kubernetes  IRSA role annotation                         ok      arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/shop-api
kubernetes  IRSA credentials injected into pods          ok      1/1 pods have AWS_WEB_IDENTITY_TOKEN_FILE
aws         IAM OIDC provider for the cluster issuer     ok      arn:aws:iam::123456789012:oidc-provider/oidc.eks.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/id/ABCDEF
aws         IRSA role exists                             ok      arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/shop-api
aws         IRSA trust policy allows the ServiceAccount  fail    the trust policy's oidc.eks.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/id/ABCDEF:sub condition allows system:serviceaccount:shop:worker but not system:serviceaccount:shop:api (or its :aud does not allow sts.amazonaws.com)
aws         Pod Identity associations                    none    none for this ServiceAccount

